menu "Lichen clock"
    config LICHEN_CLOCK_PSRAM_RECORD
        bool
        default y
        depends on SPIRAM
        select SPIRAM_ALLOW_NOINIT_SEG_EXTERNAL_MEMORY
        help
            The minute clock record (clock_save.c, #343) lives in PSRAM's no-init segment, the only store #330
            found to survive the CH340 EN (system) reset without a flash write.
endmenu
